      "src/utils.py": "set_seed calls use_deterministic_algorithms(True, warn_only=True): EVERY call downgrades strict enforcement. Core discipline: reseed_strict or an explicit enable_strict_determinism after each call, with assert_strict_determinism at the point of use.",
